    <readme>README.md</readme>
    <description>Native Monaco-style editor for WinUI 3 with C++ core, managed projection, native rendering, diff editor, language providers, LSP, IME, accessibility and globalization.</description>
    <tags>monaco editor winui winui3 native cpp lsp diff accessibility</tags>
